stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> preparing: POST /ideas/:id/publish
    preparing --> awaiting_approval: preparacion completada (postiz.status=prepared)
    preparing --> failed: error del agente
    awaiting_approval --> approved_pending: POST /publications/:id/approve
    approved_pending --> sending: POST /publications/:id/deliver
    sending --> draft: Postiz created, mode=draft
    sending --> scheduled: Postiz created, mode=schedule
    sending --> sent: Postiz created, mode=now
    sending --> skipped: sin canales configurados
    sending --> failed: error de Postiz
    draft --> [*]
    scheduled --> [*]
    sent --> [*]
    skipped --> [*]
    failed --> [*]
